---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6 text-sky-300">About</h1>
  <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-xl mb-4">
    Hi, I’m Siseko, an aspiring AI and machine learning engineer based in South Africa.
     I like turning data into things people can actually use, 
     whether that’s a model that predicts car prices or a face login that runs right in your browser.
  </p>
  <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
    I’m currently completing the FlyRank AI Internship across the Applied AI/ML and AI Fluency tracks.
    I hold a Diploma in Information Technology from Cape Peninsula University of Technology and
    have studied Generative AI at Regenesys Education.
  </p>
  <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
    I’ve built

    Car market analysis:
    A data science project comparing car models,
    exploring price against mileage and brand differences, and predicting prices with a random forest model.
    Browser-based face login:
    A computer vision project that grew out of a Haar cascade and CNN classifier
    assignment. It now runs live in the browser, where any visitor can enroll and match their face.
    This portfolio: 
    Built with Astro, React and Tailwind CSS, and deployed on Netlify.
    It includes a contact form and an AI assistant powered by the Claude API.
    The assistant is a tool-using agent that can pull in my GitHub project data to answer your questions.
  </p>
   
  
</BaseLayout>